{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Layouts"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/layouts"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"title":"Layouts","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some components can be used for "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"layouts","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"heading","text":"Colored Surface","level":3,"anchor":"Colored-Surface"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Wireframe"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Colored backgrounds use surface colors to maximize the contrast with content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The colors of several OUDS components (for instance ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink"},{"text":") are automatically adjusted if they are placed on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do so, some tokens associated with these specific colors can be customized and are identified with the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Mono","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" suffix (for instance ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"colorBgDefaultEnabledMono","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"How it works","level":4,"anchor":"How-it-works"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"According to the color, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSColoredSurface"},{"text":" component adds in SwiftUI environment two flags:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oudsUseMonochrome"},{"text":": to inform a component that needs to use mono version of tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oudsOnColoredSurface"},{"text":": to inform a component it is placed on colored surface even if the mono is off","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"How to use","level":4,"anchor":"How-to-use"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ The folowing view has a colored background \"onStatusPositiveEmphasized\" with","    \/\/ - a text with the color adapted according to the adjusted colorScheme      ","    \/\/ - a button that uses the mono version of tokens","","    \/\/ As view","    OUDSColoredSurface(color: theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized) {","        VStack {","            Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","            .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","            OUDSButton(text: \"Button\") {}","        }","    }","","    \/\/ As view modifier","","    VStack {","        Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","        .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","        OUDSButton(text: \"Button\") {}","    }","    .coloredSurface(theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Debuging contrast ratios","level":4,"anchor":"Debuging-contrast-ratios"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is for example the case for France with the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/"},{"text":", also named “RGAA”.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However it is highly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for texts and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some components like ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink"},{"text":" can be used on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface"},{"text":" ; thus in that case we can know the surface color for a given component on it, and compute the contrast ratio, and in the end display or not warnings.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To do that, some steps must be followed in your component implementation:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Rise the flag to allow debugging (e.g. i #DEBUG mode)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Get the environment variable defined by the colored surface containing the applied color","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In the component implementation, add a line of code comparing the color to test and that surface","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Then keep an eye on your logs ; warnings will be added there if WCAG 2.1 3:1, 4.5:1 or 7:1 ratios are not reached, depending to the methods you call","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Rise the flag","#if DEBUG","OUDSWCAG21Ratios.oudsDebugWCAG21Colors = true","#endif","","\/\/ Supposing we are in your component View \/ ViewModifer struct","","\/\/ Get the applied surface color","@Environment(\\.oudsSurfaceColor) var surfaceColor","","\/\/ In the function defining the color to apply, add the line below","\/\/ where colorTokenToApply is the color to apply from a theme:","","\/\/ Non-textual components, in AA","OUDSWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .nonTextual)","","\/\/ Textual components and AAA to check","OUDSWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .AAA)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Divider","level":3,"anchor":"Divider"},{"type":"heading","text":"How it works","level":4,"anchor":"How-it-works"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A divider is used to separate content elements in a view. Two kinds of divider are proposed:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider"},{"text":": to separate elements stacked vertically (e.g. in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VStack"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSVerticalDivider"},{"text":": to separate elements stacked horizontally (e.g. in `HStack)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A divider can be colored using color enumerated in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSDividerColor"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Horizontal","level":5,"anchor":"Horizontal"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Wireframe"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Vertical","level":5,"anchor":"Vertical"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Wireframe"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"How to use","level":4,"anchor":"How-to-use"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Add a vertical divider between items","HStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    OUDSVerticalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}","","\/\/ Add an horizontal divider between items","VStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    OUDSHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSDividerColor":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"List of colors available for dividers (i.e. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSHorizontalDivider"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSVerticalDivider"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsdividercolor","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSDividerColor"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor","title":"OUDSDividerColor","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSDividerColor"}]},"https://accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr/":{"type":"link","url":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/","title":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","type":"text"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/"},"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact.png"}],"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact","type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSHorizontalDivider":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Divider is a UI element that allows to structure the content by visually separating the content zones."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Divider improves readability and content organization without introducing a stronger visual hierarchy like a heading or a container would."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A horizontal Divider is used to separate content laid out one under the other (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VStack"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The divider can be colored using dedicated "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" colors."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The thickness (height) is fixed by dedicated token from "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudshorizontaldivider","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSHorizontalDivider"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider","title":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSHorizontalDivider"}]},"component_horizontalDivider_Orange":{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Orange","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Orange theme","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Orange.png"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSVerticalDivider":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Divider is a UI element that allows to structure the content by visually separating the content zones."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Divider improves readability and content organization without introducing a stronger visual hierarchy like a heading or a container would."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A vertical Divider is used to separate content laid out side by side ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HStack"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The divider can be colored using dedicated "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor"},{"type":"text","text":" colors."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The thickness (width) is fixed by dedicated token from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsverticaldivider","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSVerticalDivider"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSVerticalDivider","title":"OUDSVerticalDivider","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSVerticalDivider"}]},"component_coloredSurface_Sosh":{"type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Sosh","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Sosh.png"}]},"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact":{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact.png"}]},"component_coloredSurface_Orange":{"type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Orange theme","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Orange","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Orange.png"}]},"component_verticalDivider_Sosh":{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Sosh","alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_Sosh.png"}]},"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe":{"type":"image","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe.png"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","title":"Components","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}]},"component_verticalDivider_Orange":{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Orange","alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Orange theme","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_Orange.png"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSButton":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Button is a UI element that triggers an action or event, and is used to initiate tasks or confirming an action."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Button appears in different layouts, styles and states to indicate hierarchy or emphasis."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbutton","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSButton","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","title":"OUDSButton","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSButton","kind":"identifier"}]},"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe":{"type":"image","alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_Wireframe.png"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSColoredSurface":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Used to define if a content is used on a colored surface."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSColoredSurface","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscoloredsurface","title":"OUDSColoredSurface","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSColoredSurface","kind":"identifier"}]},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png"}]},"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact":{"type":"image","alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact.png"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLink":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Link is a UI element that allows to navigate from one location to another, either within the same page or across different pages in the same resource,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or to an external resource."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Link’s primary function is navigation and it communicates its interactive nature visually and semantically."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslink","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLink"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","title":"OUDSLink","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLink"}]},"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh":{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Sosh.png"}]},"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe":{"type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Wireframe.png"}]}}}